---
kind: lore
id: shop
title: Event shops
---
/* Pim runs the event stall. The engine owns tokens and stock; ::purchase
is a blocking bridge that answers bought / remaining. */

<beat id="pimHarvest" on="shopVisit" target="shop.harvestShop" once="false" when="@harvestShopOpen">
  @pim{code="0010" emotion="happy" when="@harvestLive"}: Welcome to the Harvest stall! The festival runs {{@harvestDaysLeft:plural(# more day|# more days)}} after today. You've got {{season.harvest.tokens:plural(# token|# tokens)}}.
  @pim{code="0020" when="!@harvestLive"}: Festival's over, but the stall stays up a few days for stragglers. {{season.harvest.tokens:plural(# token|# tokens)}} left. Use 'em.
  @pim{code="0030" emotion="smug" when="@harvestRerun && visited('harvest.h3')"}: Ah, a returning customer. You'll want the lantern costume you missed. Or the one you didn't.
  <hub id="harvestStall" prompt="What'll it be?">
    <choice id="cake" label="Moon cake (50 tokens)">
      ::purchase{item="moonCake" resultKey="buy"}
      <match on="scene.shop.buy.bought">
        <when is="true">
          @pim{code="0040" emotion="happy"}: One moon cake! Eat it under the moon or it's just a cake. {{scene.shop.buy.remaining}} tokens left.
        </when>
        <otherwise>
          @pim{code="0050"}: Short on tokens, friend. Clear a few more stages and come back.
        </otherwise>
      </match>
    </choice>
    <choice id="costume" label="Lantern costume (800 tokens)" once>
      ::purchase{item="lanternCostume" resultKey="buy"}
      <match on="scene.shop.buy.bought">
        <when is="true">
          @pim{code="0060" emotion="smug"}: The lantern costume! You'll glow. Literally. Mind the curtains.
        </when>
        <otherwise>
          @pim{code="0070"}: That's the top shelf. Eight hundred tokens. I can wait. The festival can't.
        </otherwise>
      </match>
    </choice>
    <choice id="leave" label="Just looking." exit>
      @pim{code="0080"}: Come back when your pockets jingle.
    </choice>
  </hub>
</beat>

<beat id="pimStarfall" on="shopVisit" target="shop.starShop" once="false" when="@starfallShopOpen">
  @pim{code="0010" emotion="happy" when="@starfallLive"}: Comets, glass, ribbons! Starfall runs {{@starfallDaysLeft:plural(# more night|# more nights)}} after tonight.
  @pim{code="0020" when="!@starfallLive"}: The comets have landed, but I've still got stock. {{season.starfall.tokens:plural(# token|# tokens)}}, friend.
  <hub id="starStall" prompt="Pick a comet, any comet.">
    <choice id="glass" label="Star glass (120 tokens)">
      ::purchase{item="starGlass" resultKey="buy"}
      @pim{code="0030" emotion="happy" when="scene.shop.buy.bought"}: Star glass! Look through it and every star's a little closer.
      @pim{code="0040" when="!scene.shop.buy.bought"}: Not enough tokens. Stars aren't cheap. Well. These ones aren't.
    </choice>
    <choice id="leave" label="Leave." exit>
      @pim{code="0050"}: Wish well!
    </choice>
  </hub>
</beat>

<beat id="pimClosed" on="shopVisit" target="shop.harvestShop" once="false" priority="-1">
  @pim{code="0010"}: Stall's packed up, friend. The moon'll be round again. It always is.
</beat>

<beat id="pimStarClosed" on="shopVisit" target="shop.starShop" once="false" priority="-1">
  @pim{code="0010"}: No comets tonight. Check the calendar. Pim always comes back.
</beat>

<beat id="gemShop" on="shopVisit" target="shop.gemShop" once="false">
  @lumi{code="0010" emotion="smug"}: The gem shop. I'm contractually obliged to say "great value." Great value!
  ::purchase{item="gemBundle" resultKey="gems"}
  @lumi{code="0020" emotion="happy" when="scene.shop.gems.bought"}: Thank you for supporting the stars!
</beat>

<beat id="pimFrost" on="shopVisit" target="shop.frostShop" once="false" when="@frostShopOpen">
  @pim{code="0010" emotion="happy" when="@frostLive"}: Candles, globes, mittens! The vigil runs {{@frostDaysLeft:plural(# more night|# more nights)}} after tonight.
  @pim{code="0020" when="!@frostLive"}: Ice is out, but I kept a crate back. {{season.frost.tokens:plural(# candle|# candles)}} to spend.
  <hub id="frostStall" prompt="Warm your hands and pick something.">
    <choice id="candle" label="Frost candle (30 candles)">
      ::purchase{item="frostCandle" resultKey="buy"}
      @pim{code="0030" emotion="happy" when="scene.shop.buy.bought"}: A candle for a candle. Very circular. I love it.
      @pim{code="0040" when="!scene.shop.buy.bought"}: Not enough candles to buy a candle. The irony's free.
    </choice>
    <choice id="globe" label="Snow globe (500 candles)" once>
      ::purchase{item="snowGlobe" resultKey="buy"}
      @pim{code="0050" emotion="smug" when="scene.shop.buy.bought"}: The globe! Tiny sea, tiny ice, tiny Nyx. Don't shake her.
      @pim{code="0060" when="!scene.shop.buy.bought"}: Five hundred for the globe, friend. It's hand-frozen.
    </choice>
    <choice id="leave" label="Leave." exit>
      @pim{code="0070"}: Stay warm!
    </choice>
  </hub>
</beat>

<beat id="pimFrostClosed" on="shopVisit" target="shop.frostShop" once="false" priority="-1">
  @pim{code="0010"}: Stall's frozen shut, friend. Literally. Come back next winter.
</beat>
